WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.130
if I'm trying to put

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:03.270
on multiple hats to run

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:05.190
a business I'm not being

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.450
as effective as I can

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:07.370
be in the role that

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:08.480
I can crush it in

00:00:08.527 --> 00:00:09.877
the most helpful thing for

00:00:09.887 --> 00:00:11.077
me and this is how

00:00:11.087 --> 00:00:12.657
my mind operates running a

00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:15.477
business is having the Zoom

00:00:15.487 --> 00:00:16.757
calls where I can bounce

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:20.147
ideas off get feedback that

00:00:20.157 --> 00:00:23.207
is constructive and figure out

00:00:23.217 --> 00:00:24.447
if we need to switch

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:26.167
direction or tweak a few

00:00:26.177 --> 00:00:26.657
things
